{"id": "EUVD-2026-108129", "enisaUuid": "44abf5e6-aeb1-3ec4-9df2-812fe2f23478", "description": "libyang through 6.4.13 contains an uninitialized pointer free vulnerability in lydxml_env_netconf_rpc() in src/parser_xml.c when parsing NETCONF rpc action envelopes. Peers with a NETCONF session can send an action element containing non-whitespace text via lyd_parse_op() to crash servers like netopeer2 or corrupt the heap.", "datePublished": "2026-10-22T10:57:45", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-22T10:57:45", "baseScore": 6.0, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:H/AT:P/PR:L/UI:N/VC:N/VI:N/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/CESNET/libyang/issues/2595", "https://github.com/CESNET/libyang/commit/927fce908774289a7d9c07fff5704c33965c9773", "https://github.com/CESNET/libyang/blob/v6.4.13/src/parser_xml.c#L1330-L1342", "https://github.com/CESNET/libyang/blob/v6.4.13/src/parser_xml.c#L1196-L1224", "https://hackmd.io/@haindpwn/libyang-netconf-rpc-envelope-uninit-free", "https://github.com/CESNET/libyang", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/libyang-through-6.4.13-uninitialized-pointer-free-in-netconf-rpc-parser"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-115327", "GHSA-x4q2-x59g-x339"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.0, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "4f8ed740-d704-3ea7-883f-802093c2836a", "product": {"name": "libyang", "vendor": {"name": "CESNET"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22646.4.13"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "9bdffe2d-d103-3971-aeae-a789b92940c6", "vendor": {"name": "CESNET"}}], "isExploited": false}